// Package web renders the public /status page from a status.Snapshot.
//
// The handler serves the page and a separate /status/verify_repo HTML-fragment
// endpoint. Account-page verification runs only in that second request, so slow
// PDS work cannot delay the initial page response.
//
// Fragment responses carry X-Jetstream-Status-Fragment so the browser does not
// insert HTML error pages generated by an intermediary.
//
// Templates are embedded at build time; CSS lives inside the template. The
// account view uses same-origin JavaScript to fetch the escaped result fragment.
package web
